# Recall harness

`InitDocs/` is the initial app idea (v1.2), not the final spec. Working canon is `.cursor/skills/recall-expert-harness/canon.md`. If a doc sentence conflicts with that canon, flag it instead of implementing the stale sentence.

Before architecture, capture, embedding, UI, privacy, performance, or test work, read the matching skill:

| Trigger | Skill |
|---|---|
| Docs review, experts, panel, harden the spec | `.cursor/skills/recall-expert-harness/SKILL.md` |
| Solution, DI, TFM, dependencies | `.cursor/skills/dotnet-architect/SKILL.md` |
| ONNX, MRL, ZVec, HNSW, RRF | `.cursor/skills/vectors-embeddings/SKILL.md` |
| Prefixes, languages, chunking, labels, BM25 text | `.cursor/skills/nlp/SKILL.md` |
| RIDs, watchers, iOS scan, model download | `.cursor/skills/maui-platform/SKILL.md` |
| Razor UI, onboarding, copy, a11y | `.cursor/skills/ux-ui/SKILL.md` |
| Egress, telemetry, sync design, logging | `.cursor/skills/privacy-local-first/SKILL.md` |
| Latency, RSS, disk, battery, benchmarks | `.cursor/skills/performance/SKILL.md` |
| xUnit / FsCheck unit tests | `.cursor/skills/unit-tests/SKILL.md` |
| Golden queries, corpus, crash tests | `.cursor/skills/retrieval-qa/SKILL.md` |
| MkDocs, ADRs, doc structure | `.cursor/skills/docs-mkdocs/SKILL.md` |

v1 stays local-only: no LLM, no ambient capture, no cloud vectors, no web client, sync disabled. Unresolved canon rows stay open until the user decides.
